units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice sc 6.0
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4

create_box 4 box

create_atoms 1 box

set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.25 12345
set type 1 type/fraction 3 0.25 23456
set type 1 type/fraction 4 0.25 34567

mass 1 127.60
mass 2 207.2
mass 3 208.98
mass 4 22.99

pair_style deepmd ${dp_test}
pair_coeff * * Te Pb Bi Na
replicate 10 10 10

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

timestep 0.001

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol

dump 1 all custom 100 tepbbina.lammpstrj id type x y z

run 100
